  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.0: Full chdman CLI argument parity, byte-for-byte encoder parity with MAME chdman for every codec (incl. createld/cdzs/zstd), and a battle-test harness (2611/2611 synthetic + 3003/3003 real-world). VendoredZSTD replaces the ZstdSharp.Port NuGet dependency — zero native dependencies, all codecs vendored in pure C#. 38 bugs fixed. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
